  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Plan Decenal de Educacin</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suppor for the 10-year Education Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de la operacin es contribuir a la implementacin de la Estrategia Mil por Mil de la SEE, la cual selecciona actividades y metas del Plan Decenal de Educacin 2008-2018. Dicha estrategia busca asegurar mil horas de clases de calidad al ao para todos los nios y jvenes en edad de estudiar el ciclo bsico y medio. Combina un aumento de la cantidad del tiempo efectivo de clase con una mejora en la calidad de la enseanza.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the operation is to contribute to the implementation of Strategy &quot;Mil por Mil&quot; of the SEE, which selects to activities and goals of the Decennial Plan of Education 2008-2018. This strategy looks for to assure thousand hours classes of quality to the year for all the children and young people in age to study the basic and middle cycle. It combines an increase of the amount of the effective time of class with an improvement in the quality of education.</narrative>
  </description>
